    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Egypt many years ago, Saint Anthony the Monk is visited by an Angel and told to go into the wilderness to find the Righteous Hermit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player attacks using his staff with limited stamina, so time your attacks wisely.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player has the ability to climb platforms that are too high to jump on.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid the traps &amp; any demonic surprise attacks at every corner.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ravens will sometimes randomly drop bread from the sky to increase your health.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete the level before time runs out.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn about the backstory of the Monk as you complete levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hint: Levels will automatically save if you close the game, however your score will be reset.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(This is Alpha 1, it will have unfinished parts &amp; certain features will change in the future)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Egypt many years ago, Saint Anthony the Monk is visited by an Angel and told to go into the wilderness to find the Righteous Hermit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player attacks using his staff with limited stamina, so time your attacks wisely.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player has the ability to climb platforms that are too high to jump on.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid the traps &amp; any demonic surprise attacks at every corner.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ravens will sometimes randomly drop bread from the sky to increase your health.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete the level before time runs out.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn about the backstory of the Monk as you complete levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hint: Levels will automatically save if you close the game, however your score will be reset.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(This is Alpha 1, it will have unfinished parts &amp; certain features will change in the future)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
